WEBVTT

00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:05.550
<i>Karibuchi Hikari, 
a Witch living in Sasebo, Fusou,</i>

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.690
<i>learns that her older sister, 
Karibuchi Takami,</i>

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>was assigned to the 
502nd Joint Fighter Wing,</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.490
<i>and volunteers to go to Europe, as well.</i>

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:18.900
<i>After a struggle, she succeeds.</i>

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:42.340
One!

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:44.640
Two!

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:47.730
Three!

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:57.690
Yup! Perfect!

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.530
Great!

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:36.010
<b>Episode 2
"Take Flight, Chidori"</b>

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:38.830
September, 1944.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.760
The Neuroi nest that had occupied the 
European nation of Gallia was destroyed.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:46.390
It was possible for humanity 
to defeat the Neuroi.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:49.380
Gallia was liberated,

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:53.270
but there were still lots of 
Neuroi nests around the world.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:53.270
<b>September 1944    Sasebo Port</b>

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:55.770
<b>Best Wishes in Battle</b>

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:58.280
So we ended up leaving 
for Europe as planned.

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:00.770
We were sent to different places.

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:04.680
My sister was sent to Petersburg in Orussia.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:07.790
I was sent to Kauhava in Suomus.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:10.030
Bye!

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:47.330
<b>Orussia    Petersburg</b>

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:51.910
<b>502nd Joint Fighter Wing Base</b>

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:55.790
<b>Squadron Leader Gundula Rall</b>

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:58.400
I'm proud to see my students did well.

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:02.170
Now it's our turn.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:05.150
That's why I called Takami.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:08.930
<b>Flight Sergeant Edytha Rossmann</b>

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:08.910
I'm told she was with you 
at the retreat from Libau?

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:11.790
You have a high opinion of her, don't you?

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:18.150
<b>Three Weeks Later    Above the Arctic Ocean</b>

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:37.190
It's no good.

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:38.570
I can't keep up with her.

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:40.460
I give up. I surrender.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:42.980
I win!

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.210
This is so good!

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:53.640
You've got amazing stamina, Hikaru-chan!

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.260
Hey, she's a sergeant!

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.480
Just call me Hikari!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.770
I wanted to be like my sister,

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:02.760
so I did lots and lots of running,
 and not much else.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:04.630
Sub-lieutenant Karibuchi, huh?

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:06.490
I was born in Sasebo, too,

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:07.810
and I'm proud of it.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.770
Are you going to be in her unit?

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:14.150
No, I'm going to Kauhava base in Suomus.

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:17.100
The country next to Orussia?

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:20.580
Kauhava base is an important base 
for the Suomus air force.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.910
It's not the front lines right now, but...

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:24.550
So you're with a rear unit?

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:27.210
That's right.

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:29.790
I'm still not close to being strong enough.

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:32.410
Rear support is an important mission.

00:05:32.610 --> 00:05:34.700
Resupplying and sending messages and stuff.

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:35.850
Right!

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:40.250
But someday, I want to fight 
on the front lines, like my sister.

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:42.110
So I'm going to practice a lot...

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:45.640
Clear the runway!

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.940
Sub-lieutenant Karibuchi 
is doing her training flight!

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.270
Let's go, Chidori.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:09.340
I never get tired of watching that.

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:21.370
You're being a good girl again today, huh?

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:31.270
Here you go.

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:35.720
Well?

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:37.820
It's burnt into a nice color.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.740
Okay, break time.

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.410
Good work.

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:46.000
That's so great.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:49.560
I wanted one of the new Units, too.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:53.340
Sorry. The Shiden Type-4 is a prototype.

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:56.400
You're the test pilot, right?

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:57.300
Yup.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:00.940
I think they'll be distributing 
the mass-produced Units soon.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:02.950
I hope you get one.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.870
Hey, why do you call it Chidori?

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:10.900
A chidori, or plover, is a migratory bird that 
crosses through lots of different countries.

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:15.490
So it needs the whole world to be at peace.

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:19.860
Once we defeat the Neuroi 
and bring the world back to peace,

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:22.720
I want to travel with Chidori.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.540
I want to go with you!

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:28.130
Want to try it a little?

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.730
It's not spinning right!

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:50.400
It's not like the ones at school at all!

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:53.330
Hikari!

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.560
Did you listen to Chidori's voice?

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.160
Chidori's voice?

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:13.470
Sis...?

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.460
Can I sleep with you?

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:24.520
Hey, can you hear Chidori talk to you?

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:25.300
Yeah.

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:29.450
I always listen to its voice as I fly.

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:30.620
Really?

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:36.990
We aerial Witches entrust everything to 
our Units as we fly through the sky.

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:39.570
A Unit is a Witch's soul.

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:43.800
Someday, you'll be able to understand 
what your Unit is feeling.

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:49.850
Will I be able to fight with you then?

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:55.330
I believe that you'll be an amazing Witch.

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:59.740
Your efforts will pay off.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:05.220
You won't know until you try!

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:19.180
An alarm?

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:22.510
Neuroi detected to the SSW!

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:24.070
Distance, 30,000 meters!

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:25.880
Prepare for AA combat!

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:28.330
All air Units, take off!

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:36.980
Sis, I'll fight, too!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:37.900
No.

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:39.650
Get back to your quarters!

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:42.050
Why? I'm a Witch, too!

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:44.250
You can't fight yet.

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:46.890
Sis...

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:49.140
Next time, okay?

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.580
Neuroi sighted.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:05.830
Ten medium-sized Units.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:06.930
Thirty small-sized Units!

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:08.750
They're heading straight for us.

00:10:09.010 --> 00:10:11.230
Neuroi are supposed to act alone.

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:12.560
Why are they in a pack?

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:14.870
I hadn't heard anything about that.

00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:16.500
Evasive maneuvers!

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:18.370
Hard to port!

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:21.340
Request reinforcements 
from the 502nd's Witches.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.920
Those are all Neuroi?

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:29.240
Sub-lieutenant, we didn't 
expect to see so many.

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:32.370
Hold them off somehow until 
reinforcements arrive.

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:33.270
Roger.

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:36.360
Let's go, Chidori.

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:49.680
Only the mid-sized Units have cores.

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:51.530
You can handle the smaller ones.

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:52.300
Roger!

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:02.130
There's one!

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:14.240
Next!

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.000
This is a real fight!

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:25.950
<b>Striker Unit

00:11:57.890 --> 00:11:58.850
The <i>Kishinami!</i>

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:02.480
Sis...

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:12.280
The aerial unit has lost 30% of its planes!

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.450
Please...

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:14.870
Just hold them off.

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:31.060
There are too many!

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.980
That's crazy, Hikari-chan!

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:36.390
That Unit isn't for combat!

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:37.910
I know!

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:39.150
But it can fly anyway!

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:51.970
The Unit...

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.220
The Neuroi...

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.500
I won't let you go!

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:11.320
I have to use it...

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.310
Absolute Eye!

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:29.190
Initial targeting lock.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:32.760
Ow...

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:35.350
Adjusting targets.

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:38.310
Targeting lock complete!

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:56.860
Th-The enemy formation has been wiped out!

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:00.100
She took them all out instantly?

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:02.730
What happened?

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:06.000
She did it!

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.830
That's Sub-lieutenant Karibuchi for you!

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:10.010
Sis!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:16.830
Sis!

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:27.220
Sis!

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:30.660
What is this?

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:31.380
What happened?

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:33.620
Neuroi on the northern coast!

00:14:33.860 --> 00:14:34.880
It's...

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:37.010
...a Neuroi nest!

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:39.890
What?

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:41.390
Sis!

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:42.890
Sis, are you okay?

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:44.800
I'm fine.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.320
You're not hurt, are you, Hikari?

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.240
I'm sorry, Sis...

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:54.620
If I'd been stronger, 
I could've fought with you.

00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:58.030
Sis!

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:00.960
We lost the <i>Okinami</i>, too.

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:02.410
There are more Neuroi inbound!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.720
<b>Pilot Officer Georgette Lemare</b>

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.720
<b>Flying Officer Waltrud Krupinski</b>

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:15.720
Nao-chan, you look really excited today.

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:20.890
<b>Pilot Officer Kanno Naoe

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:18.740
A Witch she knows is coming from Fusou.

00:15:18.740 --> 00:15:21.420
I think her name is... Karibuchi?

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.110
Yeah.

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:24.270
Takami is my best friend.

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:26.230
By the time we get there,

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:27.970
there might not be any Neuroi left!

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:33.200
<b>Flight Lieutenant Aleksandra Ivanovna Pokryshkin</b>

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.690
I hope she's cute.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.650
One more time, please.

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:37.240
Yes.

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:40.020
Sub-lieutenant Karibuchi is out of the fight?

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:41.750
Takami was defeated?

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.870
Sergeant, are you sure you want to do this?

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:50.050
I'm doing it.

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:52.460
If I can buy us even a second...

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:55.890
<b>Chidori</b>

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:58.220
Karibuchi Hikari, heading out!

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:03.560
<i>Chidori...</i>

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:05.850
<i>Lend me your power!</i>

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:17.240
Is that Sub-lieutenant Karibuchi?

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:17.970
No.

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:19.930
It's her younger sister.

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:21.070
Her younger sister?

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:26.830
<i>Just like you did it in training!</i>

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:33.160
It's regenerating!

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.330
I have to hit the core!

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:46.430
<i>It's my fault.</i>

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:49.350
<i>It's because I'm weak!</i>

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:57.300
<i>Sis fought many more times 
this number of enemies...</i>

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:09.910
That's...

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:13.960
It missed!

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:47.460
Those are...

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.240
...Witch reinforcements!

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:51.050
The 502nd!

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:04.810
They took out two Neuroi 
in a single instant.

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:09.970
That's the 502nd Joint Fighter Wing, 
the "Brave Witches."

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:17.060
Takami!

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:20.070
I knew they couldn't beat you—

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:22.900
Who the hell are you?

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:36.630
<b>Orussia    Novo-Kholmogory</b>

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:41.590
I am Itou of the 
European Expeditionary Force.

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:45.210
Gundula Rall, leader of the 
502nd Joint Fighter Wing.

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:48.690
So, how is Sub-lieutenant Karibuchi doing?

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:55.360
I was able to seal up her wound.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:57.650
That's all I can do.

00:18:58.460 --> 00:18:59.480
Sis!

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:01.420
Her temperature is 22 degrees.

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:02.650
Her pulse is ten beats a minute.

00:19:02.940 --> 00:19:04.550
How can she be alive?

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:06.420
It's like she's hibernating.

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:09.500
She suddenly used all her 
magical power at once.

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:13.950
She's using what's left for life support,

00:19:14.510 --> 00:19:16.600
and just barely clinging to life.

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:20.430
Sis...

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:26.480
Then... we don't know when she'll wake up?

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:27.730
That's right.

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:32.240
It could be tomorrow, or...
 she may never wake up.

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:38.060
Commander, the report said 
her hair was glowing red.

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:40.230
It can't be...

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:41.980
Did she use that?

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:43.520
What do we do?

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:45.730
With that new nest here,

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:48.160
we won't be able to use 
this sea corridor much longer.

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:52.420
The best option would be 
to return to Fusou by ship.

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:53.980
I see.

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:55.290
Understood.

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:59.420
As soon as supplies are unloaded,

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:01.340
let's send Takami back to Fusou.

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:02.530
Understood.

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:03.960
Wait!

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:07.430
She came here to fight with us, right?

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:10.230
I'm upset, as well.

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:12.930
But she can't fight anymore.

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:16.150
I have a request.

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:21.140
Please...

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:24.400
Please let me join the 502nd!

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:26.940
Who are you?

00:20:27.940 --> 00:20:29.240
Karibuchi Hikari!

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:30.230
Karibuchi?

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:32.990
I'll fight in her place!

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:35.460
Takami's little sister?

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.500
Little sister?

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:39.000
You...

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:41.730
I don't know if you're 
Takami's sister or what,

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:44.190
but you can't even fight, so shut up!

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:45.210
I'll fight!

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:46.350
I'm a Witch!

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:47.600
Hell, no!

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:49.880
If it weren't for us, you'd be dead!

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:51.850
Then...

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:54.880
Then... just let me join you until I die!

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:05.410
My sister told me she wanted to defeat 
the Neuroi and bring peace back to the world.

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:08.400
So I'll fight, too!

00:21:09.090 --> 00:21:11.320
Sasha, your thoughts?

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:14.160
She has zero combat capabilities.

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:19.790
But she lasted five minutes against 
two mid-sized Neuroi until we arrived.

00:21:20.730 --> 00:21:22.710
She survived, huh?

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:25.290
And your thoughts, Sensei?

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:29.110
You've made your choice already, right?

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:35.540
Karibuchi Hikari.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:42.860
I'll be accepting you as a member 
of the 502nd Joint Fighter Wing.

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:49.750
But if you want to fight, 
you have to get stronger.

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:54.910
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:52.960
Okay!

00:23:26.100 --> 00:23:27.910
What's with that Hikari girl?

00:23:27.910 --> 00:23:30.610
If you can't fight then get 
your butt back to Fusou!

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:31.680
Now, now, Kanno.

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:33.590
Don't say that. Let's be friends.

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:37.590
Next time, on <i>Brave Witches:</i> 
The 502nd Joint Fighter Wing.

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:39.520
I refuse to accept it!

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Episode 3
"The 502nd Joint Fighter Wing"</b>
